# **LineageOS - Ext**

## **Getting Started**

### Initialising the Repo
To save space, sync without history use:
```
 repo init --depth=1 --no-repo-verify -u https://github.com/not-samsung-sm8250/manifest.git -b lineage-24.0 --git-lfs -g default,-mips,-darwin,-notdefault
```

To sync with full history use:
```
 repo init -u https://github.com/not-samsung-sm8250/manifest.git -b lineage-24.0 --git-lfs
```

### Sync up sources
```
 repo sync -c -j24 --force-sync --no-clone-bundle --no-tags --optimized-fetch --prune
```

### Build the ROM
```
 . build/envsetup.sh
```
```
 lunch lineage_r8q-cp2a-user
```
```
 m bacon
```
